13:21.634 --> 13:24.428
Iya, terus, terus, terus, terus, terus,
terus, terus, terus, terus, terus, terus,

13:24.512 --> 13:25.179
terus, terus.

13:25.679 --> 13:28.057
Terus, terus, terus, terus, terus, terus,
terus, terus, terus, terus, terus, terus,

13:28.140 --> 13:28.891
terus, terus.

