13:45.491 --> 13:46.450
Setop-beri.

13:49.912 --> 13:52.331
-"Setop-beri."
-Lucu, kan?

13:52.414 --> 13:55.501
-Lucu, lucu!
-Lihat, kan? Makanya

13:55.584 --> 13:58.254
channel mereka nggak terkenal.

13:58.337 --> 13:59.338
